	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The authors “used the eXtreme Gradient Boosting (XGBoost) algorithm” and developed one comprehensive model plus region-specific models. Inputs were structured UNOS tabular clinical features. Model interpretation used SHAP. Predictors were chosen from clinically different features between groups and then reduced to 19 inputs after removing highly correlated variables and creating missingness indicators. Validation used 5 × 5 nested cross-validation with grid search.  ￼

